Package: PopulationExplorer
Title: Explore Australian State and Territory Population Growth
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Rikhitha", "Varma", email = "rsmn0001@stude.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides annual population estimates for Australian states
    and territories from 2010 to 2025. Includes functions for
    summarising population growth and an interactive Shiny application
    for exploring population changes over time.
